MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ComplexBool_TestComplexBool
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ComplexBool_TestComplexBool [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 5

MOVE TEMP 2 10

MOVE TEMP 3 15
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L5
 L5 CJUMP LE TEMP 2 TEMP 3 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 2 TEMP 3 L2

 
L2 
MOVE TEMP 4 1

 JUMP L4
L3 
MOVE TEMP 4 0


L4 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 4
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L9
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L6
 L9 CJUMP LE TEMP 3 TEMP 1 L7
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 3 TEMP 1 L6

 
L6 
MOVE TEMP 4 2

 JUMP L8
L7 
MOVE TEMP 4 3


L8 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 4
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L13
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L11
 L13 CJUMP LE TEMP 3 TEMP 2 L10
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 3 TEMP 2 L11

 
L10 
MOVE TEMP 4 4

 JUMP L12
L11 
MOVE TEMP 4 5


L12 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 4

RETURN 0
END

